{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g_poc","type":"group","x":-60,"y":-100,"width":3120,"height":900,"color":"6","label":"PoC pipeline — bob-onboarding-poc/"},
		{"id":"g_hack","type":"group","x":-60,"y":-1080,"width":3120,"height":680,"color":"1","label":"IBM Bob 2.0 Hackathon — constraints"},
		{"id":"req","type":"file","file":"research/ibm-bob-hackathon/requirements.md","x":0,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"theme","type":"text","text":"## Theme\nImprove a **developer workflow**.\n\nWe pitch it as *developer* onboarding (repo + role + eng culture), not generic HR onboarding.","x":520,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"judge","type":"text","text":"## Judging\n1. Application of Bob 2.0\n2. Presentation\n3. Business value\n4. Originality","x":1040,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"feat","type":"text","text":"## Bob features to show\n- Agent mode\n- Subagents / parallel tasks\n- Document understanding\n- Skills (`.bob/skills`)\n- MCP (Bob builds the email server)","x":1560,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"deliv","type":"text","text":"## Deliverables\n- Public repo\n- Problem & Solution statement ≤500 words\n- Bob Usage statement ≤500 words\n- Video ≤3 min (≥90 s of the demo)\n- Slides + cover image","x":2080,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"deadline","type":"text","text":"⏰ **Deadline: Sep 27, 11:00 PM MYT**\n(11:00 AM EDT)","x":520,"y":-640,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"evidence","type":"text","text":"📸 `bob_sessions/`\nTask-summary screenshots from **every** team member.","x":2080,"y":-640,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"rules","type":"text","text":"⚠️ No real/PII/client data → fictional Northwind Labs.\n⚠️ No IBM Cloud keys in repo.\n40 Bobcoins/person.","x":2600,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"hire","type":"text","text":"**hires/alex-tan.yaml**\nname · email · role · manager · **buddy** · **experience**","x":0,"y":0,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"role","type":"text","text":"**roles/backend-engineer.md**\nresponsibilities · ownership · 30-day success","x":0,"y":190,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"hand","type":"text","text":"**company/handbook.md**\nmission · values · ways of working","x":0,"y":380,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"skill","type":"text","text":"## Bob skill\n`onboarding-pack`\n`.bob/skills/onboarding-pack/SKILL.md`\n\nRun via Bob IDE or `bob run`","x":520,"y":225,"width":400,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sa_cult","type":"text","text":"**Subagent: Culture**\nmission · values · norms","x":1040,"y":380,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"sa_role","type":"text","text":"**Subagent: Role**\nresponsibilities · 30-day success","x":1040,"y":570,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"mcp","type":"text","text":"## Email MCP server\n`send_onboarding_email`\nSMTP creds from `.env` (Bob builds it)","x":2600,"y":140,"width":400,"height":220},
		{"id":"out_hire","type":"text","text":"📨 New hire gets the PDF pack","x":2600,"y":440,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"repo","type":"text","text":"**sample-repo/**\nreal codebase to scan","x":0,"y":570,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"check","type":"text","text":"✅ **Deterministic self-check**\nshell-verify every `path:line` exists · rationale has a source","x":2080,"y":0,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"pdf","type":"text","text":"`scripts/render_pdf.py`\nmd → PDF (written by Bob)","x":2080,"y":210,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"approve","type":"text","text":"👤 **Senior/manager curates**\nfix errors, fill \"ask your buddy\" gaps","x":2080,"y":420,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"out_mgr","type":"text","text":"📨 Manager gets the checklist before day 1","x":2600,"y":600,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"pack","type":"text","text":"## onboarding/<name>.md\nArchitecture at a glance (context → components → request flow → **why**) · Run it first · Code tour · Starter tasks · Week-1 checkpoints · Values in daily work · People to meet","x":1560,"y":0,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"mgr","type":"text","text":"## onboarding/<name>-manager.md\nJust-in-time checklist (Google's 5 actions)","x":1560,"y":480,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"sa_arch","type":"text","text":"**Subagent: Architecture**\nC4 levels · request flow · cited *why*","x":1040,"y":0,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"sa_tour","type":"text","text":"**Subagent: Code tour & setup**\nrun it · 6–10 `path:line` stops · starter tasks","x":1040,"y":190,"width":400,"height":130},
		{"id":"g_res","type":"group","label":"Research — technical onboarding (codebase & architecture)","x":-60,"y":1100,"width":3120,"height":1320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"xia","type":"text","text":"## Xia et al. — TSE/ICSE 2018\n79 devs · 3,244 h\nDevs spend **~58% of time on comprehension**; juniors & maintenance projects more.\n→ *problem statement*","x":0,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"latoza","type":"text","text":"## LaToza et al. — ICSE 2006\nMental models live in heads.\n**82%**: hard to learn *why* code is the way it is.\nDevs skip docs, interrupt teammates.\n→ *cite rationale or \"ask buddy\"*","x":520,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"sillito","type":"text","text":"## Sillito et al. — FSE 2006\n**44 question types** newcomers ask (where is X? how does data get here?)\n→ *tour answers those questions*","x":1040,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"dagenais","type":"text","text":"## Dagenais et al. — ICSE 2010 (IBM)\n18 newcomers: **early experimentation, internalizing structure, progress validation**\n→ *run it first + checkpoints*","x":1560,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"explain","type":"text","text":"## Arch. Explanations — 2025\n17 pros: tailor to **role & experience**; include **structure + behaviour + rationale** + system context\n→ *C4 levels, depth by level*","x":2080,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"archdoc","type":"text","text":"## Arch. Doc Study — 2023\n65 participants: doc **format didn't matter**; **exposure to source code** did\n→ *link everything to real files*","x":2600,"y":1180,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"ciao","type":"text","text":"## CIAO — 2026\nLLM → system-level arch docs (C4 / ISO 42010). 22 devs: valuable, broadly accurate; **minutes, cheap**. Weak: diagrams, deployment.","x":0,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"akm","type":"text","text":"## AgenticAKM — 2026\nSpecialized agents (extract → retrieve → generate → validate) beat single prompt for ADRs (29 repos)\n→ *justifies subagents*","x":520,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"lacy","type":"text","text":"## LACY — 2026 (Beko, 30K LOC)\nQuiz scores: **83% expert-curated tours vs 57% AI-only**\n→ *human curation gate*","x":1040,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tours","type":"text","text":"## LLM Code Tours — 2026\n26 devs: scale detail, don't restate code, scannable, guiding tone. **LLM self-eval unreliable**\n→ *deterministic self-check*","x":1560,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"tars","type":"text","text":"## TARS — 2026 · Modelling study — 2025\nPersonalized explanations **26% faster** (n=18); weaker hires gained **+15 pts**\n→ *`experience` field*","x":2080,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"ka","type":"text","text":"## Knowledge Activation — 2026\nInstitutional knowledge as agent **Skills**; Yahoo 67 engineers: **2.6 h/week saved**\n→ *build it as a Bob skill*","x":2600,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"res_note","type":"file","file":"research/ibm-bob-hackathon/onboarding-research.md","x":0,"y":1940,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"prior","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Prior art: Onboarding Buddy — 2025\nMulti-agent LLM + RAG, n=8, 3.26/4 helpfulness.\n**Differentiate:** role tailoring · cited rationale · deterministic checks · human gate · delivered pack","x":520,"y":1940,"width":400,"height":360,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"pitch","type":"text","text":"## Pitch (measured claims)\n1. \"Devs spend ~58% of time just understanding code.\" (Xia)\n2. \"The hardest part is *why* — and it lives in people's heads.\" (LaToza)\n3. \"AI-only onboarding underperforms (57% vs 83%) — so Bob drafts, a senior curates.\" (LACY)","x":1040,"y":1940,"width":1440,"height":360,"color":"4"}
	],
